  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3eeccab7b33c82e4f885da9ef97ed574, type: 3}
  m_Name: Blackout
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BingoGameRuleData
  ruleType: 1
  description: Complete an enabled winning pattern and submit Bingo; the default
    Blackout pattern requires every board space. A valid check starts a short tie
    window, and every other eligible player who submits a valid Bingo during that
    window also wins. An invalid Bingo submission makes that player lose. When the
    match ends, every remaining eligible player loses.
